actions.supported_help = Kurekhoda imiyalo yokukhetha eqinisekisiwe, izendlalelo ezintsha/eziyikhophi/eziyi-raster/ezihlanganisiwe, ukugcwaliswa kombala wangaphambili/wasemuva, i-Gaussian/Box/Motion Blur, i-Sharpen, i-Unsharp Mask, i-Median nokulungisa.
